# MVP Identity Naming

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-mvp-identity-naming.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-mvp-identity-naming.md)

## Locked: A

Ask once: how they call the person. Use that name in all caregiver copy. Allow change later.

Never silently infer “Mom”/given names from notes into identity. Avoid “patient / subject / your loved one.”

Internal: care_recipient_id + display_name. Display label ≠ medical identity.
